LINES = ['Pangaea never finished breaking up. Europe and America are still drifting apart.', "You can't feel it, because the Atlantic grows just two and a half centimeters a year. Slower than your fingernails.", "Since Columbus crossed it, that's about thirteen meters. Longer than a city bus.", 'Over a hundred and seventy-five million years, those centimeters tore Pangaea apart and opened a whole ocean.', 'In Iceland, the seam rises from the sea, and the island is being pulled in two.', 'So relax. Your nails are winning.']
